## Review-driven revisions

Reference feedback IDs and describe the current approved behavior. Preserve feedback history in production-state.json. Resolve material creative decisions before coding; return unexpected material changes for review.

## Sequential Studio review

Implement active SceneN only. Present project directory, npm run studio, composition ID and frame checkpoints. Wait for that scene's approval before the next. Record planned action -> implementation location -> observed result; no export before final master approval.
